  TutorTranslates:
  - <Id>k__BackingField: hello
    name: Hello, friend! You've entered a wonderful world of adventure! Fun, challenges,
      and tons of coins await you here!
  - <Id>k__BackingField: movement
    name: Look how simple it is! You can run using the joystick or the arrow keys
      on your keyboard. Try taking a step forward!
  - <Id>k__BackingField: flyExplain
    name: Your main task is to fly as far as possible, avoid traps, and set a new
      record every time!
  - <Id>k__BackingField: betZone
    name: See this glowing zone? The longer you stand on it, the more coins you'll
      get as a reward. Shall we check it out?
  - <Id>k__BackingField: x2Flight
    name: Now run to the x2 zone - it doubles your winnings.
  - <Id>k__BackingField: startZone
    name: Let's run to the start zone, the real adventure begins!
  - <Id>k__BackingField: fall
    name: Oops! Fell down? Don't worry, it happens! Get up and try again - you can
      do it!
  - <Id>k__BackingField: success
    name: Hooray! You did it! Your first coins are waiting for you. Run and claim
      your reward!
  - <Id>k__BackingField: shield
    name: Upgrade your shield. Now your coins are safe even in traps!
  - <Id>k__BackingField: petOpening
    name: And there are also cool pets and awesome skins here! Want to see? Let's
      open your first buddy!
  - <Id>k__BackingField: cutePet
    name: Wow! Look how cute! Now he'll travel with you and help you earn even more
      coins!
  - <Id>k__BackingField: miniGames
    name: 'And there''s also: parkour, basketball, trampolines, and music games!
      All in one place!'
  - <Id>k__BackingField: rangStatus
    name: 'Look at the screen: on the right - your abilities, and at the bottom -
      your rank. The more coins, the cooler your status!'
  - <Id>k__BackingField: goodLuck
    name: You're a real player now! Tutorial completed. Run forward, discover new
      things, and win. Good luck, champion!
